NOTE ON GAME CONTENT

The licence above covers the CODE of this Foundry VTT system: its JavaScript,
templates, stylesheets and the tooling around them.

It does NOT cover the ICON game content this system carries — the text of
abilities, foes, legends, relics, bonds, gear and any other rules material in
the compendia, which is drawn from the ICON 1.5 playtest book.

ICON is written, drawn and laid out by Tom Bloom, © Tom Bloom 2023, published
by Massif Press. The book's credits page states: "Please feel free to print or
share this book if you include this credits page." This system is an
unofficial, fan-made tool for that free playtest and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Tom Bloom or Massif Press. All rights to the game remain theirs.
